{#-
  src/ioc-export.njk — the full indicator index as a downloadable CSV

  Built from src/_data/iocIndex.js's `csv` string (see toCsv there). This is
  what the download button on /remote-workers/ points at; the JSON alongside it is
  the compact payload the search UI fetches, which uses one-letter keys and is
  not meant to be read by a person.

  No `layout` in the front matter, so 11ty writes the body verbatim. The
  whitespace-control markers matter: without them the comment leaves a blank
  first line, and a leading empty row breaks the header for anything parsing
  this strictly.
-#}
